ay that the US will not pay for  their security protection the Sussex  says have been vocal in their political  and ideological disagreements with Trump  dating back to at least 2016 yes of  course Trump is divisive but as far as  the couple security goes it's unclear  whether the possibility of the u.s.  paying for it was ever discussed or if  this was an assumption made by Trump our  source says that Harry and Megan have no  plans to ask the US for security  [Music]

